<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel posts 752 mln esc H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Portucel posts 752 mln esc H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	  0.75  vs   2.93 loss</p>
<p>    Total sales	     26.20  vs  22.82</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 0.74  vs   2.61 loss</p>
<p>    Financial charges	0.17  vs   0.41</p>
<p>    EBITDA		     4.32  vs   0.69</p>
<p>    Cashflow		   4.15  vs   0.28</p>
<p>    Operating margin 2.8 percent vs   11.4 percent loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Portucel Industrial-Empresa produtora de Celulose is full company name.</p>
</text>
